Hmmh.. I would tend to try something like locking your 
pet away after it got a little strength, gather it back on 
the ascension run, maybe paralyze and teleport it on the 
planes in order to avoid Bad Things To Happen (dragon collateral 
damage and such), and pray that you can whistle it through 
the fire portal before it gets killed by the fire traps.  
Of course, this rules out conflict, but on astral, confused 
taming is much better anyway IMHO.   

If you really want your pet to accompany you all the time, 
that's really tough.  I'd say the green slime idea is the best 
bet I can see, but all the possible collateral damages are really 
fearsome.  In case it's not mentioned yet, I believe one should 
genocide all digesting monsters too, since they tend to kill 
without leaving corpses.  
 
